# Copy to web/.env.local and fill in what you need. Never commit .env.local.
#
# Everything here is OPTIONAL and everything here ends up readable in the published JavaScript
# bundle. Nothing that can sign or spend belongs in this file. The keys that can write to Arkiv
# (ARKIV_WRITER_PRIVATE_KEY, ARKIV_WATCHER_PRIVATE_KEY) live in the repo-root .env, are read only
# by the watcher, and must never be given a VITE_ prefix -- that prefix is what publishes a value
# to the browser.

# ---- Baseline publication -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Where the watcher's publisher endpoint is reachable from the browser (watcher/src/server.ts,
# enabled by ARGOS_HTTP_PORT in the root .env). Leave empty and Add Contract will say, honestly,
# that this build has no publisher and nothing was submitted anywhere.
VITE_ARGOS_API_URL=
# Shared secret the publisher expects as `Authorization: Bearer`. Must match ARGOS_PUBLISH_TOKEN
# in the root .env. It gates casual use of a write endpoint; the server still re-reads every fact
# from its own RPC, so this token cannot talk Argos into baselining code that was never deployed.
VITE_ARGOS_PUBLISH_TOKEN=

# ---- Arkiv reads ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional rate-limit key (https://hub.arkiv.network/access-keys). Empty = keyless public
# endpoint, which Arkiv rate limits heavily; when that happens the UI reports a failed read
# rather than showing an empty portfolio. Setting it publishes the key in the bundle, so anyone
# can spend its quota. Read token only -- it cannot write.
VITE_ARKIV_ACCESS_KEY=

# ---- Chain RPCs --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Default to public endpoints. Chain reads go direct from the browser and every result says so.
VITE_MAINNET_RPC_URL=
VITE_SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=
# Gateway used to fetch Swarm content (descriptors, 0G explanations). Content is hash-verified
# after fetching, so a hostile gateway can withhold bytes but cannot substitute them.
VITE_SWARM_GATEWAY=
